.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# This repository lives inside a Dropbox folder, so duplicates appear on their
# own. One already reached the tree before these patterns existed
# (`country_tracker (4).xlsx`), which is what they are here to prevent.
*conflicted copy*
* ([0-9]).*
*.sb-*

